      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sacul%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Texas and New Orleans Railroad spurred Sacul’s growth, building a rail stop a few miles from Tolivar shortly after 1900.",
